---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage title="Privacy Policy | Recur">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-12">Last updated: December 2026</p>

  <div class="max-w-none space-y-10 text-foreground">
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      This policy explains what Recur collects, how we use it, and the choices you have.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Website</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Our website (<a href="https://recur.fit" class="text-primary hover:underline">recur.fit</a>) uses <a href="https://posthog.com/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">PostHog</a> analytics in cookieless mode: no cookies, no stored identifiers, no IP addresses, and no tracking across sessions or other sites. We see page views, clicks, the country you visit from and which sites send visitors, in aggregate, and we honor Do Not Track.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">When you use the Recur app, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your email address</li>
        <li>Workout history and preferences</li>
        <li>Injuries or pain points you choose to share</li>
        <li>Device information, app usage data and crash reports</li>
        <li>For adults, recordings of how you move through the app, with passwords hidden</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">How We Use It</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain and improve Recur</li>
        <li>Personalize your workouts</li>
        <li>Send product updates and announcements</li>
        <li>Respond to your questions and feedback</li>
        <li>Save finished workouts to Apple Health or Health Connect, if you turn it on (we don't read your health data)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4">
        We share information only with the providers that help us run Recur, such as hosting, analytics, crash reporting and subscription processing. We never sell it or use it for advertising.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Age Requirements</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Recur is for people 13 and older and isn't directed to children under 13. Where the App Store or Google Play supports it and the law requires it, the app asks the store for your age range. We use the answer only to decide whether you can use Recur and to turn off session recordings for anyone under 18, and we don't keep it or send it to analytics.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        If you believe a child under 13 has given us personal information, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@recur.fit" class="text-primary hover:underline">hello@recur.fit</a> and we'll delete it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Your Choices</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We keep your information for as long as you have an account. You can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Delete your account and its data at any time in the app's settings</li>
        <li>Ask us for a copy of your information, or to correct it</li>
        <li>Unsubscribe from product emails using the link in any email</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Security</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        We use reasonable measures to protect your information, but no method of sending or storing data is completely secure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@recur.fit" class="text-primary hover:underline">hello@recur.fit</a>. If we change it, we'll post the update here and change the date at the top.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</ContentPage>
